pp_ctl.c: Preserve capabilities in saved regex state.

rxres_save serializes RX_SAVED_COPY, RX_SUBBEG and the optional copied
match buffer through UV slots. A UV is 64 bits here while a pointer is a
128-bit capability, so rxres_restore recovers the address without its tag.
The later SvREFCNT_dec(saved_copy) faults when lex.t releases a regexp.

Use pointer-typed fields for the three pointers and retain UV slots only
for numeric match offsets. This remains valid on ordinary pointer targets.

--- a/pp_ctl.c
+++ b/pp_ctl.c
